{"answerArea":{"calculator":true,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The formula for the derivative of $\\arcsin(x)$ is:\n\n$\\dfrac{d}{dx}[\\arcsin(x)]=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's start by finding $\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\arcsin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{6}\\right)\\right]$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\arcsin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{6}\\right)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\left(\\dfrac{x}{6}\\right)^2}}\\cdot\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\dfrac{x}{6}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{6\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{x^2}{36}}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Now we evaluate $\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\arcsin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{6}\\right)\\right]$ at $\\blueD{x=4}$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\dfrac{1}{6\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{\\left(\\blueD{4}\\right)^2}{36}}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{6\\sqrt{\\dfrac{5}{9}}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{5}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, the value of $\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\arcsin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{6}\\right)\\right]$ at $x=4$ is $\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{5}}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Evaluate $\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\arcsin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{6}\\right)\\right]$ at $x=4$.**\n\n[[☃ expression 1]]\n\n*Use an exact expression.*","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"considered":"correct","form":false,"key":0,"simplify":false,"value":"\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{5}}"}],"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
